+# Plan
+
+1. Make the private DELETE facade resolve categories through the merchant-scoped lookup and throw `ResourceNotFoundException` for an absent category, so missing IDs return HTTP 404.
+2. Rewrite category service deletion to gather the target category and all descendants, find products attached to any of them, remove only those category associations, and save each product.
+3. Delete the affected categories deepest-first (or otherwise safely with the existing child cascade), leaving products and all non-deleted category associations intact.
+4. Review the resulting diff for unintended cart/order/product deletion behavior and compile/run the focused core and shop tests, followed by the full Maven verification if practical.
